  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-09-15.grg.aud.km184.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 10 songs; 57 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]\n- **billystrings2019-09-15.m20.flac24**: source not stated; 10 songs; 58 min [3]\n- **billystrings2019-09-15**: source not stated; 10 songs; 58 min [4]\n- **billystrings2019-09-15.grg.aud.km184.flac24**: audience recording; 10 songs; 57 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The taper notes mark this as Billy Strings' first show at Red Rocks Amphitheater [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-09-15.grg.aud.km184.flac16**: taped by gerry gladu; transferred by gerry gladu; source: aud> Neumann KM 184 stereo set (ortf, OTS)> GAKable XLR silvers> Sound Devices MixPre-3 (24bit/96kHz)> Sound Devices SDHC card [1]\n- **billystrings2019-09-15.m20.flac24**: taped by Todd R; transferred by Todd R; source: Gefell m20 > nbob/pfa actives > Sound Devices MixPre 6 (24/48) [3]. Also: Transfer went from SD card through Amadeus Pro and xACT to 24-bit FLAC; Todd R also processed and tracked it [3]\n- **billystrings2019-09-15**: taped by Rob O'Brien; transferred by Rob O'Brien; source: DPA 4011(DIN) > Edirol R-44[Oade Mod](24/48) [4]. Also: Recorded with DPA 4011 mics (DIN) into a modified Edirol R-44 at 24/48, from row 16, about seven feet up; Processing: SDHC to PC, Wave Lab 6.1 for levels, fades and edits, CD Wave for tracking, then TLH at level 8 [4]\n- **billystrings2019-09-15.grg.aud.km184.flac24**: taped by gerry gladu; transferred by gerry gladu; source: aud> Neumann KM 184 stereo set (ortf, OTS)> GAKable XLR silvers> Sound Devices MixPre-3 (24bit/96kHz)> Sound Devices SDHC card [2]",
